ord)'; GitHub appears only as tickets_remote='https://github.com/navapbc/rebar' — a public mirror URL, not a decision-bearing auth provider.","search of src/rebar/review_bot for 'Github'/'github' returns only the mirror remote URL; there is no GitHub adapter, client, or credential.","docs/adr/0098 line 459 (governing RP-04 ADR) non-goals: 'RP-04 does not add ... concrete future GitHub/GitLab/Jenkins bridge support.'","Plan step 2 itself names only 'focused Git/Gerrit policy' — omitting GitHub — making the GitHub references in Outcome/Testing/AC internally inconsistent.","ADR 0098 line 459 describes GitHub/GitLab/Jenkins as 'concrete future ... bridge' i.e. not-yet-existing."],"finding":"The plan asserts a review-bot GitHub decision-bearing auth capability (Outcome: 'Gerrit/GitHub/LLM capabilities are typed and adapter-local'; Testing: 'valid/missing/conflicting/revoked Gerrit/GitHub auth'; AC line 3: 'revoked/missing/conflicting auth never falls back to another principal'), but no GitHub auth integration exists in review-bot and the governing ADR excludes it from scope.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f9ad1f90e2b547b07","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Outcome; Plan step 2; Testing bullet 3; Acceptance Criteria line 3","norm_id":"nf0bc51ad455af111","priority":0.7,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer writes the 'revoked/missing/conflicting GitHub auth' tests required by Testing bullet 3 and AC line 3, but there is no GitHub auth code path to exercise.","Reviewer signs off AC line 3 as met when only Gerrit auth was actually validated, masking a scope gap."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Replace 'Gerrit/GitHub/LLM' with 'Gerrit/LLM' throughout (Outcome, Testing bullet 3, AC line 3) since review-bot has no GitHub decision-bearing auth and ADR 0098 excludes GitHub bridge support; keep the 'only the selected integration is constructed' language scoped to the integrations that actually exist (Gerrit + LLM)."